---
import SincePreview from './previews/SincePreview.astro';
import { PRODUCT_NAME } from '../../config';
---
<section class="s wrap rule fs" id="catch-up" data-name="Since" aria-labelledby="c-h">
  <div class="feat">
    <div class="copy">
      <h2 id="c-h">See what happened <span class="soft">since you last looked.</span></h2>
      <p>{PRODUCT_NAME} keeps a checkpoint, a commit, not a clock. It lists everything merged on your base after it, day by day, with a reader beside it that shows who made each change, its description and every file. Move the checkpoint with Mark since, and <kbd>⌘Z</kbd> puts it back.</p>
    </div>
    <SincePreview />
    <div class="facts3 facts4">
      <div><h4>Any starting point</h4><p>Your checkpoint, yesterday, last week or a tag, on any branch. <kbd>⇧T</kbd></p></div>
      <div><h4>Read it like a review</h4><p>Tick files with <kbd>V</kbd> and they fold. <kbd>,</kbd> <kbd>.</kbd> between files, <kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> between PRs.</p></div>
      <div><h4>Stacks as one row</h4><p>A merged stack is one item. Open it to read the parts, bottom first.</p></div>
      <div><h4>Who made it</h4><p>The author, plus the agent its commit trailers name.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
